{"name":"Dermal rollers / microneedling eyes","deep":true,"image":null,"mentions":18,"casual":{"lead":["Dermal rollers and similar microneedling tools puncture the skin repeatedly with fine needles. Looksmaxxing communities use them around the eyes hoping to thicken thin skin, soften dark circles and reduce a tired look.","Proponents say the tiny punctures trigger wound-healing and collagen production. Microneedling, also called collagen induction therapy, has been studied mainly for acne scars, wrinkles and hair loss; no trials reviewed examined it specifically for the eye area."],"sections":[{"h":"How people use it","paras":["Clinicians use handheld rollers and stamping devices, and rollers are also sold for home use. People typically repeat sessions over weeks and combine them with ordinary skincare."],"subs":[]},{"h":"Risks & side effects","paras":["Wikipedia notes safety concerns about non-medical settings where staff lack infection-control training, citing a 2018 New Mexico health warning and a 2024 CDC announcement of HIV diagnoses in three women after microneedling with platelet-rich plasma at an unlicensed spa. The periorbital skin is delicate and close to the eye."],"subs":[]}]},"gallery":[],"links":{"studies":[],"trials":[],"label":null,"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"derma stamp/ roller","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/derma-stamp-roller.1791277/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251229071727/https://looksmax.org/threads/derma-stamp-roller.1791277/"},{"title":"derma stamp on roller on eyebrows","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/derma-stamp-on-roller-on-eyebrows.1789934/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228150409/https://looksmax.org/threads/derma-stamp-on-roller-on-eyebrows.1789934/"},{"title":"dermaroller or dermastamp","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-or-dermastamp.1275680/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250114140938/https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-or-dermastamp.1275680/"},{"title":"dermaroller how deep","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-how-deep.879970/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20231121150234/https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-how-deep.879970/"},{"title":"dermaroller or dermastamp","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-or-dermastamp.760648/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240217141147/https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-or-dermastamp.760648/"},{"title":"dermaroller minoxidil 5 any norwood experts pls","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-minoxidil-5-any-norwood-experts-pls.54116/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220811175154/https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-minoxidil-5-any-norwood-experts-pls.54116/"},{"title":"low effort dermaroller 0 5mm minoxidil guide","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/low-effort-dermaroller-0-5mm-minoxidil-guide.1821055/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260201221914/https://looksmax.org/threads/low-effort-dermaroller-0-5mm-minoxidil-guide.1821055/"},{"title":"can you use derma stamp under eyes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/can-you-use-derma-stamp-under-eyes.1789631/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228103507/https://looksmax.org/threads/can-you-use-derma-stamp-under-eyes.1789631/"},{"title":"is derma stamp microneedling","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/is-derma-stamp-microneedling.1759181/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260303174755/https://looksmax.org/threads/is-derma-stamp-microneedling.1759181/"},{"title":"can i use a dermaroller instead of a derma stamp for my eyebrows","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/can-i-use-a-dermaroller-instead-of-a-derma-stamp-for-my-eyebrows.1741042/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260115094516/https://looksmax.org/threads/can-i-use-a-dermaroller-instead-of-a-derma-stamp-for-my-eyebrows.1741042/"},{"title":"i managed to get rid of my blue violet dark circles with a dermaroller","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/i-managed-to-get-rid-of-my-blue-violet-dark-circles-with-a-dermaroller.1711379/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251204002727/https://looksmax.org/threads/i-managed-to-get-rid-of-my-blue-violet-dark-circles-with-a-dermaroller.1711379/"},{"title":"what mm dermaroller for under eyes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/what-mm-dermaroller-for-under-eyes.879984/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20231121141147/https://looksmax.org/threads/what-mm-dermaroller-for-under-eyes.879984/"},{"title":"tretinoin 1 night urea cream next night derma stamp once a week try it for two months","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/tretinoin-1-night-urea-cream-next-night-derma-stamp-once-a-week-try-it-for-two-months.635456/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20230609121656/https://looksmax.org/threads/tretinoin-1-night-urea-cream-next-night-derma-stamp-once-a-week-try-it-for-two-months.635456/"},{"title":"never using dermaroller again","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/never-using-dermaroller-again.594024/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20221111072300/https://looksmax.org/threads/never-using-dermaroller-again.594024/"},{"title":"shocking dermaroller transformation","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/shocking-dermaroller-transformation.24545/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250814091343/https://looksmax.org/threads/shocking-dermaroller-transformation.24545/"},{"title":"1 50mm or 2 00mm dermaroller","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/1-50mm-or-2-00mm-dermaroller.22482/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250715125406/https://looksmax.org/threads/1-50mm-or-2-00mm-dermaroller.22482/"},{"title":"Layman' Training Log/Diary - Bodybuilding - (Red Pill/Blue Pill)","url":"https://t-nation.com/t/layman-training-log-diary-bodybuilding-red-pill-blue-pill/263454","site":"T Nation · 1064 posts · 2019"},{"title":"what dermaroller should i buy","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/what-dermaroller-should-i-buy.21546/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250916221540/https://looksmax.org/threads/what-dermaroller-should-i-buy.21546/"},{"title":"anyone here used using dermaroller","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/anyone-here-used-using-dermaroller.670/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220523155158/https://looksmax.org/threads/anyone-here-used-using-dermaroller.670/"}],"news":[],"social":[],"web":[{"title":"Microneedling - Wikipedia","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Microneedling"}]},"angle":{"goal":"Eyes & eye area","chain":["Needling triggers collagen response","Thin under-eye skin thickens","Softer circles, smoother skin"],"effect":"claimed","text":"Users needle the skin around the eyes to trigger a collagen response, hoping to thicken thin under-eye skin and soften dark circles. Microneedling has been studied for scars, wrinkles and hair loss, with little specific to the eye area."},"wikipedia":null,"grokipedia":null,"lead":["Microneedling, also called collagen induction therapy, skin needling or dermarolling, is a cosmetic procedure that repeatedly punctures the skin with tiny sterile needles.[1] Handheld rollers and stamping devices are used by clinicians, and rollers are also sold for home use.[1]","In looksmaxxing circles, needling the periorbital skin is discussed as a way to thicken thin under-eye skin and improve its appearance. No trial reviewed for this entry examined microneedling specifically for the eye area.[1]","The best-studied uses of microneedling are acne and other scars, and it has been combined with minoxidil for hair loss in a 2013 pilot study.[1]"],"infobox":[["Type","Skin needling device"],["Also called","Collagen induction therapy, dermarolling[1]"],["Studied uses","Scars, acne scars, wrinkles, hair loss adjunct[1]"],["Eye-area evidence","No dedicated trials identified"]],"sections":[{"h":"Description","paras":["Wikipedia describes microneedling as repeated puncturing of the skin with sterile needles, distinct from microneedles used for transdermal drug delivery. Devices include rollers and stamping tools used by nurses and physicians for scar reduction.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Evidence","paras":["Cited studies on Wikipedia include work on upper-lip wrinkles (Fabbrocini et al., 2012), histological collagen changes combined with platelet-rich plasma (Abuaf et al., 2016), a split-face trial of platelet-rich plasma plus microneedling for atrophic acne scars (Asif, Kanodia and Singh, 2016), and a pilot study of microneedling with minoxidil for hair loss (Dhurat et al., 2013).[1] Efficacy of microneedling combined with platelet-rich plasma, sometimes marketed as a vampire facial, is described as awaiting scientific studies.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Safety","paras":["Safety concerns focus on non-medical settings without infection control. In September 2018 the New Mexico Department of Health warned that one such business could potentially spread blood-borne infections, and in April 2024 the US CDC announced that three women who had visited the same Albuquerque spa were diagnosed with HIV after vampire facials.[1]"],"subs":[]},{"h":"Clinical studies","paras":["No studies found for the eye area specifically. Studies of microneedling in other areas of the body and face, such as acne scars and wrinkles, exist.[1]"],"subs":[]}],"lore":null,"timeline":[],"refs":[{"title":"Microneedling","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Microneedling","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"type":"encyclopedia"}],"studies":[{"title":"Microneedling","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Microneedling","source":"Wikipedia","year":2026,"kind":null}],"reddit":[],"forums":[{"title":"derma stamp/ roller","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/derma-stamp-roller.1791277/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251229071727/https://looksmax.org/threads/derma-stamp-roller.1791277/"},{"title":"derma stamp on roller on eyebrows","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/derma-stamp-on-roller-on-eyebrows.1789934/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20251228150409/https://looksmax.org/threads/derma-stamp-on-roller-on-eyebrows.1789934/"},{"title":"dermaroller or dermastamp","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-or-dermastamp.1275680/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20250114140938/https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-or-dermastamp.1275680/"},{"title":"dermaroller how deep","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-how-deep.879970/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20231121150234/https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-how-deep.879970/"},{"title":"dermaroller or dermastamp","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-or-dermastamp.760648/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20240217141147/https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-or-dermastamp.760648/"},{"title":"dermaroller minoxidil 5 any norwood experts pls","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-minoxidil-5-any-norwood-experts-pls.54116/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20220811175154/https://looksmax.org/threads/dermaroller-minoxidil-5-any-norwood-experts-pls.54116/"},{"title":"low effort dermaroller 0 5mm minoxidil guide","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/low-effort-dermaroller-0-5mm-minoxidil-guide.1821055/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.archive.org/web/20260201221914/https://looksmax.org/threads/low-effort-dermaroller-0-5mm-minoxidil-guide.1821055/"},{"title":"can you use derma stamp under eyes","url":"https://looksmax.org/threads/can-you-use-derma-stamp-under-eyes.1789631/","site":"looksmax.org","archived":"https://web.a